(text "TEN COMMANDS + SIX USER TOUCH KEYS / BS8116A-3"(at 19.05 19.05 0)(effects(font(size 1.4 1.4))(justify left top))(uuid "17d5cb68-a06a-4145-a1f4-1c76a41fbff3"))
(text "U91 fixed address0x50 on GPIO21 SCL / GPIO13 SDA (software I2C). U90 stays on internal I2C.\nExternal4.7k pull-ups to3.3V. All16 keys used. Key16 defaults to IRQ: clear K16_TH bit6 (0xC4), follow full configuration write protocol."(at 19.05 25.4 0)(effects(font(size 0.95 0.95))(justify left top))(uuid "29ccb50c-e2db-4330-bb6f-72d5505d3a37"))
