(text "PLAY/PAUSE: tap toggles; hold2s requests STOP/Hi-Z. DEBUG: request analysis mode.\nLOAD/SAVE: select action, then slot1..4. DELETE: hold slot2s. No physical switches.\nTouch discrimination, full copper routing and firmware integration remain to be validated."(at 25.4 254.0 0)(effects(font(size 1 1))(justify left top))(uuid "49dcdc99-02dc-4324-876f-d231117538ad"))
